Story 1:
Introduction of new product IOP (IELTS on Paper) in the CMDS UI.
As the IELTS Global Ops, we have activated our IOP Product into the lower environments,
So now we can view the IOP Product along with the other products in the product management screen.
 
Story 2:
 
Previously as the IELTS Global Ops, we were facing an issue where we have to manually add or remove all the products for the test centers and their respective physical building.
But now we have cascaded the Test Center products approvals to all their respective physical buildings. So, we can now bulk add or remove the products in one go.
 
Story 3:
We have introduced the Allocation Group Landing page where we can manage our allocation groups, we setup the RBAC and CRUD permissions for our allocation groups, so that we can manage which user can have the access to view the allocation groups and afterward which permissions they have to perform the CRUD operations for the products.
 
Story 4:
After creating the Allocation Group page and setting the necessary permissions, now we need the View allocation Group Page.
So we have developed the view allocation Group page from, as an authorized user with necessary permissions we can view all the allocation.
Now to add allocation groups, we created the allocation group page from where, as an authorized user with necessary permissions we can add allocation group by providing the allocation group name and status.
Story 5:
Now suppose if the user wants to update an allocation group, then he needs an update feature.
So, for that we have developed the updated Allocation Group page, as an authorized user with the necessary permissions we can update our allocation group.
Similarly, if the user wants to view the details of a particular allocation group, the they can view  the particular allocation group by clicking on the allocation group from the list of all  allocation groups.
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
